  "method_notes": [
    "OSR attainment is full-year total own-source revenue including FIF/AiA divided by the published target, as reported by the National Treasury using Controller of Budget data.",
    "Pending-bills burden is the published total pending bills as a percentage of the FY 2024/25 approved county budget. Narok is null because the final table records no submitted pending-bills value.",
    "Wage compliance is a categorical accountability signal, not a scored index component. The final BROP states that only eight counties were at or below the statutory 35% ceiling; their rounded ratios are retained exactly as stated in the text.",
    "Audit opinion is a categorical accountability signal, not a scored component. The OAG summary states that no County Executive recorded an unqualified opinion in FY 2023/24. Exact 'Qualified' labels are stored only for the 25 counties explicitly visible in Appendix 1(a)'s indexed table extract; other exact modified-opinion classes are left null rather than guessed."
